'''The Great Potato War''' was a semi-unofficial event that occurred between users {{RN|yt|im_a_squid_kid}} and {{RN|pig|Technoblade}}, who competed to see who could maintain the highest [[Potato]] Collection.

Eventually, it was decided that the first to reach 500 million Potato Collection would win the war.

On June 21, 2020, {{RN|pig|rank=no|Technoblade}} reached 500 million Potato Collection, and the [[Potato King]] was added in front of the Map on the [[Hub Island]] for 7 days and gave players exclusive items. It is highly unlikely that the [[NPC]] will be available in the future.

== List of Items related to The War ==
Some of the related items quote Sun Tzu's "[[w:The Art of War|The Art of War]]", which Technoblade frequently mentioned in his videos.
* {{Item|Potato Talisman}}
** Given to anyone who talks to the {{NPCSprite|Potato King}}

* {{Item|Basket of Hope from the Great Potato War}}
** Given to those who were ranked top #1000 in '''Potato Collection'''

* {{Item|Potato War Silver Medal}}
** Given to the player ranked #2 in '''Potato Collection''' ({{RN|yt|rank=no|im_a_squid_kid}})

* {{Item|Potato Crown}}
** Given to the player ranked #1 in '''Potato Collection''' ({{RN|pig|rank=no|Technoblade}})

